msgstr "A nine-tailed fox named NHK (Nihilistic, Handsome Kitsune) that you keep inside your body.  It kidnapped the Tohoku sisters, forced a contract on them and possessed their bodies.  The silver hair and red eyes are the price of the contract.  Sadly, you were made to waive your right to cancel."

