msgstr "What?  Do you need something from cool-beauty me?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_CUL.json TALK_CUL_SAN_2
msgid "いいだろう、この私が手伝ってやろうじゃないか"
msgstr "Very well, I shall lend you a hand."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_FLOWER.json TALK_FLOWER_SAN_1
msgid "ど、どなたですか・・？"
msgstr "W-who are you...?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_FLOWER.json TALK_FLOWER_SAN_2
msgid "よろしくお願いします"
msgstr "Nice to meet you."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_GALACO.json TALK_GALACO_SAN_1
msgid "アンタさー、どこかで農業に適した土地知らない？"
msgstr "Hey, you know any land good for farming around here?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_GALACO.json TALK_GALACO_SAN_2
msgid "サンキュー！見つけたら教えてくれよな"
msgstr "Thanks!  Tell me if you find some, OK?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_HIME.json TALK_HIME_SAN_1
msgid "なんばしょっと？"
msgstr "Whatcha doin'?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_HIME.json TALK_HIME_SAN_1
msgid "仲間になってください(仲間に勧誘)"
msgstr "Please join me. (invite to join)"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_HIME.json TALK_HIME_SAN_2
msgid "よかよか"
msgstr "Sure, sure."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_IA.json TALK_IA_SAN_1
msgid "ああ、他にも生きてる人がいたんだ…！"
msgstr "Oh, there's someone else alive...!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_IA.json TALK_IA_SAN_1
msgid "大丈夫?手助けが必要かな？(仲間に勧誘)"
msgstr "Are you OK?  Need a hand? (invite to join)"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_IA.json TALK_IA_SAN_2
msgid "助かった…ありがとう！あ、当分は一緒に行動させてもらうね！"
msgstr "You saved me... thank you!  Oh, I'll be tagging along with you for a while!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ITAKO.json TALK_ITAKO_SAN_1
msgid "うーん…お金かあ"
msgstr "Hmm... money, huh."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ITAKO.json TALK_ITAKO_SAN_1
msgid "はぁ～……楽してお金稼ぎたいですわ～……。"
msgstr "Haa... I wish I could make money the easy way..."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ITAKO.json TALK_ITAKO_SAN_1
msgid "一緒にお金を稼ぎましょう！(仲間に勧誘)"
msgstr "Let's make money together! (invite to join)"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ITAKO.json TALK_ITAKO_SAN_2
msgid "妖狐の力、見せてさしあげますわ！"
msgstr "I'll show you the power of a fox spirit!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_KATUWO.json TALK_KATUWO_SAN_1
msgid "仲間になってー"
msgstr "Join meee."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_KIRITAN.json TALK_KIRITAN_SAN_1
msgid "ずんねえさま検定1級、きりたんです。"
msgstr "I'm Kiritan, holder of the first-grade Zun-nee certification."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_KIRITAN.json TALK_KIRITAN_SAN_2
msgid "うぇーい。あ、ずんねえさま探してくださいずんねえさま、ずん姉さま成分が現在不足してるんですよ"
msgstr "Yaaay.  Oh, please look for Zun-nee.  I'm running low on Zun-nee right now."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_KOU.json TALK_KOU_SAN_1
msgid "あ、君、よかったら一緒に行動してもいいかい？この辺見たことない生物がいっぱいいてね…"
msgstr "Ah, you there, mind if I tag along?  There are lots of creatures around here I've never seen..."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_KOU.json TALK_KOU_SAN_1
msgid "いいよ(仲間に勧誘)"
msgstr "Sure. (invite to join)"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_KOU.json TALK_KOU_SAN_2
msgid "すまない、恩に着るよ"
msgstr "Sorry, I owe you one."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_MAKI.json TALK_MAKI_SAN_1
msgid "うーん？"
msgstr "Hmm?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_MAKI.json TALK_MAKI_SAN_1
msgid "ちょっとそこの君！ゆかりん見なかった―？"
msgstr "Hey, you there!  Have you seen Yukarin?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_MAKI.json TALK_MAKI_SAN_1
msgid "一緒に探してあげてもいいよ！"
msgstr "I can help you look for her!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_MAKI.json TALK_MAKI_SAN_2
msgid "ヨロシクねー♪ゆかりんは一体どこにいるんだろうね"
msgstr "Nice to meet you♪  I wonder where Yukarin could be."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_METAN.json TALK_METAN_SAN_1
msgid "ふるさと女学院、高等部2年生。ずん子のクラスメイトよ。"
msgstr "Second-year at Furusato Girls' High School.  I'm Zunko's classmate."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_METAN.json TALK_METAN_SAN_2
msgid "さあ、わたくしの前にひれ伏しなさい！"
msgstr "Now, bow down before me!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_MIKOTO.json TALK_MIKOTO_SAN_1
msgid "怪しい子だ…"
msgstr "What a suspicious kid..."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_MIKOTO.json TALK_MIKOTO_SAN_1
msgid "愚かな人間どもよ!"
msgstr "Foolish humans!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_MIKOTO.json TALK_MIKOTO_SAN_2
msgid "しょうがないなー"
msgstr "Oh, fine."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_NO7.json TALK_NO7_SAN_1
msgid "どうかしましたか?"
msgstr "Is something the matter?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ONE.json TALK_ONE_SAN_1
msgid "ちょっと！そこの君、私の姉知らない?"
msgstr "Hey!  You there, do you know my big sister?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ONE.json TALK_ONE_SAN_2
msgid "せっかくだからついていくね、あ、何かお菓子持ってない?"
msgstr "Since I'm here, I'll come with you.  Oh, do you have any snacks?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_RIKKA.json TALK_RIKKA_SAN_1
msgid "ここは・・・どこ・・・ですか・・・"
msgstr "Where... is... this..."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_RIKKA.json TALK_RIKKA_SAN_2
msgid "助かった…ありがとう！あ、当分は一緒に行動させてもらうね！あ、ラキストンもお腹減ったって"
msgstr "You saved me... thank you!  Oh, I'll be tagging along with you for a while!  Oh, Lakiston says he's hungry too."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_RITHU.json TALK_RITHU_SAN_1
msgid "アンタは誰だ?"
msgstr "Who the hell are you?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_RITHU.json TALK_RITHU_SAN_2
msgid "仕方ねえな、協力してやるよ"
msgstr "Guess I've got no choice.  I'll help you out."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SASARA.json TALK_SASARA_SAN_1
msgid "ちょっと、つづみちゃん知らない？あとタカハシも"
msgstr "Hey, do you know where Tsuzumi-chan is?  And Takahashi too."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SASARA.json TALK_SASARA_SAN_1
msgid "一緒に探そうか?"
msgstr "Want to look for them together?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SASARA.json TALK_SASARA_SAN_2
msgid "まったく、二人はどこに行っちゃったんだろう…"
msgstr "Honestly, where did those two go..."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SEIKA.json TALK_SEIKA_SAN_1
msgid "ありますよ(仲間に勧誘)"
msgstr "I do. (invite to join)"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SEIKA.json TALK_SEIKA_SAN_1
msgid "いいや、ないよ"
msgstr "Nope, I don't."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SEIKA.json TALK_SEIKA_SAN_1
msgid "おや、こんなとこに人が来るなんて珍しいこともありますね、…お酒持ってないですか？"
msgstr "Oh my, how rare for someone to come to a place like this... You don't happen to have any alcohol?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SEIKA.json TALK_SEIKA_SAN_2
msgid "やった！これでまたお酒にありつけそうです。"
msgstr "Yay!  Looks like I'll get my hands on some drinks again."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SHOTA.json TALK_SHOTA_SAN_1
msgid "アイは…？"
msgstr "Where's Ai...?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SHOTA.json TALK_SHOTA_SAN_2
msgid "アイを探さなきゃ…"
msgstr "I have to find Ai..."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SORA.json TALK_SORA_SAN_1
msgid "あらあら、生きてる人なんて久々に見ましたね"
msgstr "My my, it's been a while since I saw someone alive."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_SORA.json TALK_SORA_SAN_2
msgid "お姉さんにお任せ！"
msgstr "Leave it to big sis!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TAKAHASHI.json TALK_TAKAHASHI_SAN_1
msgid "いいえ"
msgstr "No"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TAKAHASHI.json TALK_TAKAHASHI_SAN_1
msgid "はい(仲間に勧誘)"
msgstr "Yes (invite to join)"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TAKAHASHI.json TALK_TAKAHASHI_SAN_1
msgid "ﾅﾆﾆｼﾏｽｶ?"
msgstr "WHAT CAN I DO FOR YOU?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TETO.json TALK_TETO_SAN_1
msgid "誰だい、君は?"
msgstr "Who are you?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TETO.json TALK_TETO_SAN_2
msgid "こんな状況だし、誰かといたほうが良いかも…君についていくよ。よろしくね。"
msgstr "With things like this, it might be better to stick with someone... I'll follow you.  Nice to meet you."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TUINA.json TALK_TUINA_SAN_1
msgid "ウチは大人のれでーやで！"
msgstr "I'm a grown-up lady, y'know!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TUINA.json TALK_TUINA_SAN_2
msgid "よっしゃ！それじゃ、いってみよー！"
msgstr "Alright!  Here we go!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TUMUGI.json TALK_TUMUGI_SAN_1
msgid "あーしは春日部つむぎだよ"
msgstr "Ah'm Kasukabe Tsumugi!"

