msgid "あーしに任せて！あ、今日のご飯はカレーでヨロシクー♪"
msgstr "Leave it to me!  Oh, curry for dinner tonight, 'kay♪"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TUZUMI.json TALK_TUZUMI_SAN_1
msgid "そこの貴方、面白そうな本持ってないかしら?"
msgstr "You there, do you have any interesting books?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TUZUMI.json TALK_TUZUMI_SAN_1
msgid "今持ってないです…"
msgstr "I don't have any right now..."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TUZUMI.json TALK_TUZUMI_SAN_1
msgid "持ってるよ(仲間に勧誘)"
msgstr "I do. (invite to join)"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_TUZUMI.json TALK_TUZUMI_SAN_2
msgid "書店や図書館あったら寄ってね、…そういえばささらちゃんたちはどこへ行ったのかしらね"
msgstr "Stop by any bookstores or libraries, all right?  ...Come to think of it, I wonder where Sasara-chan and the others went."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_UNA.json TALK_UNA_SAN_1
msgid "うえーん…ここどこ？"
msgstr "Waaah... where am I?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_UNA.json TALK_UNA_SAN_1
msgid "よかったら一緒に行動しないかい？(仲間に勧誘)"
msgstr "Want to come with me? (invite to join)"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_UNA.json TALK_UNA_SAN_2
msgid "ありがとうなぎ！"
msgstr "Thank you, eel-y much!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_YUKARI.json TALK_YUKARISAN_1
msgid "ゆかりさんは天才ですから仲間になってあげてもいいですよ？"
msgstr "Yukari-san is a genius, so I could join you, you know?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_YUKARI.json TALK_YUKARISAN_2
msgid "これから仲良くしましょうね"
msgstr "Let's get along from now on."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_YUKARI.json TALK_YUKARISAN_2
msgid "やったね"
msgstr "Great."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ZUNDAMON.json TALK_ZUNDAMON_SAN_1
msgid "ずんだもんなのだ！"
msgstr "I'm Zundamon, nanoda!"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ZUNDAMON.json TALK_ZUNDAMON_SAN_2
msgid "あとはずんだもんに任せるといいのだ"
msgstr "Just leave the rest to Zundamon, nanoda."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ZUNKO.json TALK_ZUNKO_SAN_1
msgid "あら、こんなとこに人が来るなんて珍しいですね、ずんだ餅でもどうです？"
msgstr "Oh, how rare for someone to come to a place like this.  How about some zunda mochi?"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ZUNKO.json TALK_ZUNKO_SAN_1
msgid "いただきます(仲間に勧誘)"
msgstr "Thanks, I'll have some. (invite to join)"

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ZUNKO.json TALK_ZUNKO_SAN_1
msgid "ずんだ餅はちょっと…"
msgstr "Zunda mochi, not really..."

#: npcs/TALK/TALK_ZUNKO.json TALK_ZUNKO_SAN_2
msgid "うふふ、気に入ってくれたなら毎日ずんだ餅を作ってあげますからね♪"
msgstr "Ufufu, if you like it, I'll make you zunda mochi every day♪"

