msgstr "Why is it right in front of us!"

#: npcs/TALK/talk_tags_MAKI.json <danger_close_distance_maki>
msgid "怖い…！"
msgstr "I'm scared...!"

#: npcs/TALK/talk_tags_MAKI.json <done_mugging_maki>
