msgstr "Thanks for the goodies♪"

#: npcs/TALK/talk_tags_MAKI.json <done_mugging_maki>
msgid "ぎゅんぎゅん行くよ～！"
msgstr "Let's rock and roll~!"

#: npcs/TALK/talk_tags_MAKI.json <done_mugging_maki>
