#: professions.json voiro_captain_yukamillan
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「どうも皆さんこんにちは。ゾンビサバイバルのプロ、ゆかりさんです。」\n7 Days to Die、Survival Method、Dying Light、Corridor Z、Zombie Derby 2、Project Zomboid、DeadRising3、Death Road to Canada、BIOHAZARD RE:2、Mist Survival、They are billions、COD:BO2 ORIGINS、Zombie Army Trilogy…etc…そしてMinecraft。数多の世界でゾンビを屠って来ました。「ｽﾃﾝﾊﾞｲ……ｽﾃﾝﾊﾞｰｲ……GO！」ワンマンアーミーゆかりさんがニューイングランドを往く！"
msgstr "\"Hello everyone.  It's Yukari-san, the zombie survival pro.\"\n7 Days to Die, Survival Method, Dying Light, Corridor Z, Zombie Derby 2, Project Zomboid, Dead Rising 3, Death Road to Canada, BIOHAZARD RE:2, Mist Survival, They Are Billions, COD:BO2 ORIGINS, Zombie Army Trilogy... etc... and Minecraft.  You've slaughtered zombies in countless worlds.  \"Stand by... stand byyy... GO!\"  One-man army Yukari-san marches through New England!"

#: professions.json voiro_captain_yukamillan
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "「どうも皆さんこんにちは。ゾンビサバイバルのプロ、ゆかりさんです。」\n7 Days to Die、Survival Method、Dying Light、Corridor Z、Zombie Derby 2、Project Zomboid、DeadRising3、Death Road to Canada、BIOHAZARD RE:2、Mist Survival、They are billions、COD:BO2 ORIGINS、Zombie Army Trilogy…etc…そしてMinecraft。数多の世界でゾンビを屠って来ました。「ｽﾃﾝﾊﾞｲ……ｽﾃﾝﾊﾞｰｲ……GO！」ワンマンアーミーゆかりさんがニューイングランドを往く！"
msgstr "\"Hello everyone.  It's Yukari-san, the zombie survival pro.\"\n7 Days to Die, Survival Method, Dying Light, Corridor Z, Zombie Derby 2, Project Zomboid, Dead Rising 3, Death Road to Canada, BIOHAZARD RE:2, Mist Survival, They Are Billions, COD:BO2 ORIGINS, Zombie Army Trilogy... etc... and Minecraft.  You've slaughtered zombies in countless worlds.  \"Stand by... stand byyy... GO!\"  One-man army Yukari-san marches through New England!"

