#: professions.json voiro_haruno_sora
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「桜乃そら、17歳でーす。・・・・・おいおい☆」\nアメリカの大自然が今なお残る、ホワイトマウンテン国立公園近隣の再開発にやってきました。最近は建物を破壊する臭い人たちが多くて困ってます！"
msgstr "\"I'm Haruno Sora, 17 years old.  .....Hey now☆\"\nYou came to redevelop the area near White Mountain National Forest, where America's wilderness still remains.  Lately there are lots of smelly people destroying buildings, and it's a pain!"

