#: professions.json voiro_kisaragi_tuina
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「ウチはモノノケ退治のすぺしゃりすとやで！」\nモノノケの仕業かおじーちゃんの仕業か知らんけど、アメリカがえらいっこちゃで！　こーなったら、ウチの力で皆まとめて鬼は外や！　さぁさ皆様お立会い、方相氏ついなちゃんの鬼やらいの時間やで！"
msgstr "\"I'm a specialist in exterminatin' mononoke!\"\nDunno if it's mononoke or grandpa's doin', but America's in a real mess!  In that case, I'll use my power to throw all the oni out together!  Now, now, gather round everyone, it's time for Hososhi Tsuina-chan's oni exorcism!"

