#: professions.json voiro_meika_hime
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「おっしょい！　おっしょい！　おっしょい！　おっしょい！　おっしょい！　おっしょい！」\nミコトと花との3人でニューイングランド随一の紅葉が楽しめるバーモント州に遊びに来ていました。燃え盛る様な紅葉が見事な土地ですが、その日は全てが燃えていました。見失った2人を探し出して、梅は無理でも沢山の草木を蘇らせましょう！"
msgstr "\"Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!\"\nYou came with Mikoto and Hana to Vermont, home of the best autumn leaves in New England.  A land of leaves that look like they're on fire, but that day, everything really was burning.  Find the two you lost, and if not plums, then bring back lots of plants and trees!"

#: professions.json voiro_meika_hime
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "「おっしょい！　おっしょい！　おっしょい！　おっしょい！　おっしょい！　おっしょい！」\nミコトと花との3人でニューイングランド随一の紅葉が楽しめるバーモント州に遊びに来ていました。燃え盛る様な紅葉が見事な土地ですが、その日は全てが燃えていました。見失った2人を探し出して、梅は無理でも沢山の草木を蘇らせましょう！"
msgstr "\"Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!  Ossho-i!\"\nYou came with Mikoto and Hana to Vermont, home of the best autumn leaves in New England.  A land of leaves that look like they're on fire, but that day, everything really was burning.  Find the two you lost, and if not plums, then bring back lots of plants and trees!"

#: professions.json voiro_meika_hime
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "梅の精霊[VOIRO]"
msgstr "plum spirit[VOIRO]"

#: professions.json voiro_meika_hime
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "梅の精霊[VOIRO]"
msgstr "plum spirit[VOIRO]"

#: professions.json voiro_meika_mikoto
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「あ どっこいしょ！ どっこいしょ！」\n大変動の日、ふらふらと居なくなったヒメを探していたら花ともはぐれてしまいました。シェルター生活では何故かずんだ餅とラーメンばかりが提供されていたので暫く食べたくありません。物資も無くなり、2人の安否を確認しに行く時が来ました。"
msgstr "\"A-dokkoisho!  Dokkoisho!\"\nOn the day of the Cataclysm, you went looking for Hime, who had wandered off, and got separated from Hana too.  For some reason the shelter served nothing but zunda mochi and ramen, so you don't want to eat them for a while.  Supplies have run out, and it's time to go check that the two are safe."

#: professions.json voiro_meika_mikoto
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "「あ どっこいしょ！ どっこいしょ！」\n大変動の日、ふらふらと居なくなったヒメを探していたら花ともはぐれてしまいました。シェルター生活では何故かずんだ餅とラーメンばかりが提供されていたので暫く食べたくありません。物資も無くなり、2人の安否を確認しに行く時が来ました。"
msgstr "\"A-dokkoisho!  Dokkoisho!\"\nOn the day of the Cataclysm, you went looking for Hime, who had wandered off, and got separated from Hana too.  For some reason the shelter served nothing but zunda mochi and ramen, so you don't want to eat them for a while.  Supplies have run out, and it's time to go check that the two are safe."

#: professions.json voiro_metan
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "今日はごはんを探してニューイングランドへ!しかし人が全然見当たりません・・・。しかしごはんや寝る場所にはありつけそうですね"
msgstr "Today you came to New England looking for food!  But there's no one around at all...  Still, it looks like you can find food and a place to sleep."

#: professions.json voiro_metan
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "今日はごはんを探してニューイングランドへ!しかし人が全然見当たりません・・・。しかしごはんや寝る場所にはありつけそうですね"
msgstr "Today you came to New England looking for food!  But there's no one around at all...  Still, it looks like you can find food and a place to sleep."

