#: professions.json voiro_minase_kou
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「得意教科は国語で、面白いことわざを紹介するのが好きです。」\n大災害の1週間前、バーモント州のとある小学校に赴任して来ました。長い休暇の後、これから子供達の成長を見守っていく筈だった学び舎は灰燼に帰していました。妹の為に戦う兄、姉を探すランチャー少女…この地に希望の光はまだ灯っています。"
msgstr "\"My best subject is Japanese, and I love sharing interesting proverbs.\"\nA week before the disaster, you were posted to an elementary school in Vermont.  After a long vacation, the school where you were to watch the children grow had been burned to ashes.  A brother fighting for his sister, a launcher girl searching for her big sister... the light of hope still burns in this land."

#: professions.json voiro_minase_kou
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "「得意教科は国語で、面白いことわざを紹介するのが好きです。」\n大災害の1週間前、バーモント州のとある小学校に赴任して来ました。長い休暇の後、これから子供達の成長を見守っていく筈だった学び舎は灰燼に帰していました。妹の為に戦う兄、姉を探すランチャー少女…この地に希望の光はまだ灯っています。"
msgstr "\"My best subject is Japanese, and I love sharing interesting proverbs.\"\nA week before the disaster, you were posted to an elementary school in Vermont.  After a long vacation, the school where you were to watch the children grow had been burned to ashes.  A brother fighting for his sister, a launcher girl searching for her big sister... the light of hope still burns in this land."

