#: professions.json voiro_mochiko
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "亡き祖父が遺した模型店に勤める、次期店長をめざす優しい女の子です。今日はニューイングランドで開催される世界的なホビーショーに参加する予定でしたが…会場でゾンビが現れ大パニック！命からがら逃げだすことに成功しましたが、さてこれからどうしましょう…"
msgstr "A kind girl who works at the model shop left by her late grandfather, aiming to become its next manager.  Today she was going to attend a worldwide hobby show held in New England... but zombies appeared at the venue and it turned into a panic!  She barely escaped with her life, but what now..."

