#: professions.json voiro_nozomi
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「音声合成のAITalkをご存知ですか？」\n同期のゆかりさんが消息不明になったという連絡を受け、葵ちゃん達に同行する形で捜索に来ました。ひとまずはゲームセンターを目指すべきでしょうか？"
msgstr "\"Have you heard of the AITalk speech synthesizer?\"\nYou heard that your coworker Yukari had gone missing, and came to search for her along with Aoi and the others.  Should you head for the game center first?"

