#: professions.json voiro_takahashi
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「好きな食べ物はラーメンです。」\nささらとつづみに置いて行かれ、後を追っては来たものの大災害に巻き込まれました。シェルターでのラーメンは大盛況でしたが、人も去り、手持ちのラーメンもあと僅か。こうなったら小麦を育てて、全米に「パワーヌードル」の名を知らしめてやりましょう！"
msgstr "\"My favorite food is ramen.\"\nSasara and Tsuzumi left you behind; you followed them, only to get caught in the disaster.  Your ramen was a huge hit in the shelter, but the people have left and your ramen is almost gone.  Then it's time to grow wheat and make the name \"Power Noodle\" known across America!"

#: professions.json voiro_takahashi
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "「好きな食べ物はラーメンです。」\nささらとつづみに置いて行かれ、後を追っては来たものの大災害に巻き込まれました。シェルターでのラーメンは大盛況でしたが、人も去り、手持ちのラーメンもあと僅か。こうなったら小麦を育てて、全米に「パワーヌードル」の名を知らしめてやりましょう！"
msgstr "\"My favorite food is ramen.\"\nSasara and Tsuzumi left you behind; you followed them, only to get caught in the disaster.  Your ramen was a huge hit in the shelter, but the people have left and your ramen is almost gone.  Then it's time to grow wheat and make the name \"Power Noodle\" known across America!"

