#: professions.json voiro_tsurumaki_maki
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「ぎゅんぎゅん行くよー！」\njamバンドのメンバーとアメリカ横断ライブハウス巡りの最中、大異変に巻き込まれ仲間とはぐれました。いざと言う時に頼りになるカナちゃんと、ロボタがいるから皆は心配ないけど…今は愛器のむすタンだけが心の拠り所です。"
msgstr "\"Let's rock and roll!\"\nYou were caught in the Cataclysm while touring live houses across America with your jam band, and got separated from them.  Kana-chan and Robota are reliable in a pinch, so the others should be fine... but right now your beloved Mustang is all you have to lean on."

