msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "「前略、母さん元気ですか？」\n「人と地球にやさしい世界征服」を企む悪の秘密結社「鷹の爪団」が誇る島根の星、吉田くんを模した着ぐるみを売り込む為に単身渡米しました。帰りの便が見つかると良いのですが。"
msgstr "\"Dear Mom, how are you?\"\nYou came to America alone to sell mascot costumes modeled on Yoshida-kun, the star of Shimane and pride of Eagle Talon, the evil secret society plotting \"world conquest that's kind to people and the Earth\".  Hopefully you'll find a flight home."

